 "notes": [
  "Posted 4 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "No starting section; cards marked '(start)' in their sections: Squadron Assignments, Strike Planning, The Shield Is Down! (posted 'The Sheild is Down') and Heading For The Medical Frigate. The Objective deploys Endor and Rebel Landing Site. All count toward the total. Three Effects are marked as starting and the post names none as the starting Effect, so none is set.",
  "Total is 61 as published (section headers say Characters 18, Starships 6, Effects 11, Interrupts 7, Locations 7, but the rows add to 61). The strategy's 'Response to reviews' says 'its 61 cards. A simple miscount... Take out YISYW'; kept as posted.",
  "Posted 'The Sheild is Down' dested the Tatooine Effect The Shield Is Down! (original printing, not the V); 'Anakin's Saber' dested Anakin's Lightsaber; 'Punch It' dested Punch It!; 'Endor' dested the Light Endor system; 'Endor Back Door', 'Endor Bunker', 'Endor Chief Chirpa's Hut', 'Endor Rebel Landing Site (Forest)' dested the Endor: sites; 'Rebel Strike Team/Garrison Destroyed' dested the Objective.",
  "Don't Do That Again is a 2001 Effect (not a Reflections III Defensive Shield), counted in the total.",
